Z||000008||pontiacs4me||04-21-2001||09:30 PM||||Last summer regular unleaded topped out at 1.84 a gallon.  There were an estimated 20 gas and go's each day at each gas station in town.  They made the punishment for gas and go's 60 day suspended liscense.  Last summer all I had was my firebird, and at 12 mpg on premium, it got rather costly.  Premium hit 1.96 a gallon.  We have to do something, this is getting rediculous. They could charge 10 dollars a gallon, and what are we going to do, more gas and go's.  I think its all apart of a conspiracy.  ||||reg||1
Z||000009||Cameron||04-21-2001||10:51 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Black88GT:<BR><B>If you forward this message to...<P>5 people - you will race a C5 and win<BR>10 people - your Fiero will grow 17" rims<BR>20 people - you will wake up with a northstar '88 t-top in your driveway<P>This is really true, take John D. from Ohio for example, he didn't follow the directions and the next day his Fiero burnt to a crisp!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Hum, I wonder what would happen if I sent it to 10 people since my fiero already has 17" rims.  Would it grow a second set???  wowie.  A fiero with duelies!!!<BR>hehe that would be a sight  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Cameron<BR> <A HREF="http://Fiero.NetMARC.com" TARGET=_blank>http://Fiero.NetMARC.com</A> <p>[This message has been edited by Cameron (edited 04-21-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000010||Neverfinished||04-22-2001||09:27 PM||||I think if all the big is better idiots with their excursions and navigators and such would use their gas for a better cause... namely, pouring it on their trucks and watching them burn, we won't have so much of a problem. Another thing that stings me is that people in the richest country in the world (will remain unnamed) can actually be upset about what they are paying for gas. Canadians are getting f-ed over even though we don't use a fraction of the gas that the unnamed country does. <BR>But that is the price we canadians must pay for living in the best country in the world.<BR>Imagine americans for 1 second...<BR>paying 4 dollars for a gallon of gas.<BR>But with that aside... gas prices suck and I am very bitter... very very very bitter...||||reg||8
